  "body": "Apparently OSI webite was restructured a bit some time ago. Old links to license info return HTTP 301 redirects. While it's not a problem for a browser to follow such link, some kind of parser logic at SPDX erroneously detects such URL as \"no longer live\" when you see \"Other web pages for this license\" on SPDX website.\r\n",
